    <string name="help_demo">Demo replies are made up on the R1 itself; nothing is sent anywhere. Pick OpenClaw, OpenAI or Claude to talk to a real model.</string>
    <string name="help_openclaw">ribbitOS talks to the gateway’s /v1/chat/completions endpoint, and the gateway keeps the conversation. The token is an operator credential: keep the gateway on your LAN or tailnet.</string>
    <string name="help_openai">OpenAI’s Chat Completions API. Any server that speaks it works too: change the URL. The key is kept on this R1 only.</string>
    <string name="help_claude">Anthropic’s Claude API. The key is kept on this R1 only.</string>
